    "q-14409": {
      "dom_id": "step-q14409",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to $\\frac{s-t}{s+3t}\\cdot \\frac{s+3t}{s-t}?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we cancel any terms that appear in both a numerator and a denominator. Then, we multiply the numerators and the denominators as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{s-t}{s+3t}\\cdot \\frac{s+3t}{s-t} & =\\frac{\\cancel{(s-t)}}{\\cancel{(s+3t)}}\\cdot \\frac{\\cancel{(s+3t)}}{\\cancel{(s-t)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1}\\cdot \\frac{1}{1} \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-14409-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "s-t",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"8\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D460 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-14409-b",
